  {
    "uuid": "c9ff6bc2-bfb2-5c70-8d24-616bad622da3",
    "entry": "銀将",
    "reading": {
      "primary": "ぎんしょう",
      "alternatives": [],
      "is_heteronym": false
    },
    "grammar": {
      "pos": [
        "名詞"
      ],
      "ctype": null,
      "inflections": null
    },
    "definitions": [
      {
        "index": 1,
        "gloss": "silver general",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "将棋で銀将を上手に活用することが、勝利の鍵となる。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "銀将は斜めと上に動くことができる重要な駒だ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "初心者向けの将棋講座では、銀将の動かし方を最初に学ぶ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": [
            {
              "text": "金将たり、銀将たり、飛車角、桂香を以て自ら任じつつ飯喰い種にして行く者が滔々として皆｜然りであるが、その飯喰い種を皆棄てて、将棋盤の外にいて将棋を指している奴は、なかなか居るものでない。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "近世快人伝",
                "author": "夢野久作",
                "note": "青空文庫"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
    "relations": {
      "homophones": [
